  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Les d\u00e9fis de la diversit\u00e9 culturelle dans le monde du travail au XXIe si\u00e8cle (2020), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one \u2014 the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Les d\u00e9fis de la diversit\u00e9 culturelle dans le monde du travail au XXIe si\u00e8cle by Ariane Le Moing, Sa\u00efd Ouaked and Christ\u00e8le Le Bihan was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2020. It is part of the Travail et Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 / Work and Society series. Conceptually, the work connects to Art.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Reduced inequalities among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
